Package: rfm
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Eugene Chertikhin <e.chertikhin@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6
Recommends: openssh-client, curl
Description: lightweight terminal file manager
 Panel-based console file manager written in Rust: multiple panels,
 command line with real shell screen, archives and remote locations
 (sftp/ftp/http) as virtual file systems, built-in viewer and editor,
 mouse support and configurable color themes.
